*   **`dropZones` Array:** Stores information about each drop zone (position, size, color).
*   **`setup()`:** Initializes the canvas, creates the parts and drop zones.  It also splits the sentence into an array of words.
*   **`draw()`:** Draws the parts and drop zones.
